# User Service API Testing Script
# Use with REST Client extension in VS Code or any HTTP client

@baseUrl = http://localhost:4001/api
@token = YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### Health Check (No Auth Required)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Get Metrics (No Auth Required)
GET http://localhost:4001/metrics

###
### USER PROFILE ENDPOINTS
###

### 1. Get Current User Profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2. Create/Update User Profile
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "test_user_123",
  "display_name": "Test User"
}

### 3. Search Users by Username
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/search?q=test
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
### FRIEND MANAGEMENT ENDPOINTS
###

### 4. Get Accepted Friends List
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/friends
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. Get Pending Friend Requests (Received)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/friends/pending
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. Get Sent Friend Requests
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/friends/sent
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. Send Friend Request
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/friends/request
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "another_user"
}

### 8. Accept Friend Request
# Replace FRIEND_USER_ID with actual UUID
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/friends/FRIEND_USER_ID/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 9. Reject Friend Request
# Replace FRIEND_USER_ID with actual UUID
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/friends/FRIEND_USER_ID/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 10. Remove Friend
# Replace FRIEND_USER_ID with actual UUID
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/users/friends/FRIEND_USER_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
### ERROR TESTING
###

### Test 1: Missing Auth Token (Should return 401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/profile

### Test 2: Invalid Auth Token (Should return 401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/profile
Authorization: Bearer invalid_token_here

### Test 3: Invalid Username (Should return 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "ab",
  "display_name": "Too Short"
}

### Test 4: Invalid Username Format (Should return 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "User With Spaces",
  "display_name": "Invalid Format"
}

### Test 5: Search Without Query (Should return 400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/search
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Test 6: Add Yourself as Friend (Should return 400)
# Replace YOUR_USER_ID with your actual UUID
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/friends/YOUR_USER_ID/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

